--- !u!114 &1029686810
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1029686808}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '

    <size=120%><b>GUIDE</b></size>


    <b>Goal:</b> Get the evidence
    and escape through the exit without being caught.


    - <b>Characters:</b>
    The <color=#FF3B3B><b>red arrow</b></color> is the guard and the <color=#3B8BFF><b>blue
    arrow</b></color> is you

    (Player).

    - <b>Move:</b> Use W key or the
    Up arrow key to walk, and use the mouse pointer to change direction.

    - <b>Exit:</b>
    The <color=#3BD14F><b>green floor</b></color> tile is the exit(top left). Reach
    it with the item to win.

    - <b>Evidence:</b> The <color=#FFD93B><b>yellow
    box</b></color> in the corner is the evidence(top righ). Pick it up before heading
    to the exit.

    - <b>Stay hidden:</b> Stay out of the guard''s vision cone.
    Walls and Crates block his view.

    - <b>Watch the cone:</b> Yellow means the
    guard is suspicious and will check the area. Red means he has seen you and will
    chase.

    - <b>Break line of sight:</b> If he loses you, he returns to patrol
    after a short time.

    - <b>Pick up the item:</b> Walk over it. This starts
    the alarm, so plan your escape route first.

    - <b>Gun:</b> A gun guards the
    item. It points at you and fires from the start, so stay behind cover and corners.

    -
    <b>After the alarm:</b> Once you pick up the item, the alarm turns on and the
    guard runs faster.

    - <b>Escape:</b> Reach the exit with the item to win.


    <size=120%><b>RULES</b></size>


    -
    <b>1.</b> You must pick up the item before the exit will work.

    - <b>2.</b>
    If the guard catches you while chasing, you lose.

    - <b>3.</b> If the guard''s
    bullets hit you, you lose.

    - <b>4.</b> Picking up the item turns on the
    alarm, and the guard''s speed increases.

    - <b>5.</b> While the alarm is
    on, the guard fires at you whenever he has line of sight.

    - <b>6.</b> Reaching
    the exit with the item wins the game. Reaching it without the item does nothing.

    -
    <b>7.</b> After a win or loss, press Restart to play again.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
